{"product_id":"m-series-magical-tales-from-the-hidden-continent","title":"M Series: Magical Tales from the Hidden Continent","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhy a M series? Much of what makes for a masterful story starts with the letter M ... Mysteries, Magic, Monsters! The M series promises to be a marvellous mix of all three. Magical Tales from the Hidden Continent is the first book in the M series. Many years ago, the Lord of All Magic, fed up with the intrusion of humans into the lives of magical beings, withdrew to a continent in the middle of the Pacific Ocean that he hid, by magical means, from the sight of all humans outside. As the two tales from the hidden continent show, life with magical creatures can never be dull ...\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 203 x 47\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Shashi Warrier\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9789352774296\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 180\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45301980397721,"sku":"16RD-1-9789352774296","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/50930643_897d15f2-f527-4bab-bb7c-5b45fae5dda6.jpg?v=1760433831","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/m-series-magical-tales-from-the-hidden-continent","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}